'''Shrink''' is a stackable debuff. It can be found in areas such as the boss room of [[The Cursed King (boss)|The Cursed King]] ({{il|Dark Forest Map}}), or the encounter with [[Rotfeather Talisman]] possessed monster.

==Version history==
In the past, one of the unique [[Perandus]] monster also casts this debuff. However, the whole league mechanic is removed from the game in [[version 3.16.0]], thus that monster is no longer encounterable.
